; Shared delivery policy and priority are a vocabulary of their own.
; Queue is a policy variant here, not the Metaflow queue collection type.
Library
[ :crate:generated:library:Request ] ; request body is shared by every priority
[ Message.[ HardAbrupt.Request ; interruption requested by the sender
            MiddleAbrupt.Request ; insertion at the next boundary
            Soft.Request ] ; insertion after the active turn
  Delivery.[ Queue Wake ] ] ; whether an asleep recipient is explicitly woken
[] ; no traits
[] ; no associations
